    "title": "WhiteBooks GST returns: GSTR7",
    "version": "2026-10-13",
    "description": "Operations of the WhiteBooks GST returns API in the group GSTR7, as of 2026-10-13. Start on the sandbox; every call needs your own WhiteBooks credentials and a session as the sign-in sequence describes."
